  "adaptations": [
    "Preserve Agent Pi host peer compatibility and managed Team/compaction boundaries, including the new drain entrypoint",
    "Delegate desktop restart to Electron",
    "Retain complete Office 0.4.0 integration and exact reviewed IM/email compatibility gates",
    "Retain Intel optional-native capability exclusions",
    "Retain upstream drain barriers, release-age and profile-policy preservation",
    "Rebuild adapted source with the pinned DSH toolchain",
    "Expose a permanent market update check with bounded requests and reuse the existing self-update/source-confirmation route",
    "Show actionable desktop pnpm-layout migration guidance; product startup performs backed-up migration before loading plugins",
    "Merge the complete official 1.73.9 runtime fixes; retain exact fixed-commit source and npm integrity",
    "Permit only three exact verified product bundled links to switch to registry releases after explicit source confirmation; retain and verify original-source rollback",
    "Disclose that independent community-market upgrades replace product market UI adaptations while preserving DSH, project data and host migration protection",
    "Translate market maintenance actions and source confirmation into ten product languages and translate existing check status on language changes",
    "Accept reviewed IM 5.9.1 and email 0.21.2 only with the fixed DSH source pin and exact verified runtime file hashes"
  ],
